      pseudo-inverted.
    rcond: `Tensor` of small singular value cutoffs.  Singular values smaller
      (in modulus) than `rcond` * largest_singular_value (again, in modulus) are
      set to zero. Must broadcast against `tf.shape(a)[:-2]`.
